			"notes": "[1.0.3-beta]\nThe initial submission of the musicbox has been completed, implementing the functionality of converting URLs in OGG format into in-game sound effects. The following modifications were made:\n\n1. A mixin was applied to the SoundEngine sound system, enabling it to accept and play functions with InputBuffer parameters.\n\n2. Added the musicbox, which stores music in the entity's musicPlayer object.\n\n3. Renamed and moved some files.\n\n4. Created textures for the musicbox.\n\n5. Fixed the issue where music wouldn't stop after the musicbox was destroyed.\n\n6. It is now possible to play songs using .ogg music links.\n\nIt is now working correctly on the server.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ChisatoNishikigi73/ChisatosMoreRedstone/compare/1.19.2-forge-1.0.2-beta...1.19.2-forge-1.0.3-beta"
		},
